[{"start": 5.39, "end": 10.39, "text": "刚刚得到消息,主公要收留刘备,并且要把新野交给他驻军。"}, {"start": 12.39, "end": 17.39, "text": "你们听着,刘备此人,向来都是假称仁义,可是他心怀大志。"}, {"start": 18.39, "end": 25.39, "text": "尤其他手下三员猛将,关羽,张飞,赵云,各个是勇猛无比。"}, {"start": 27.39, "end": 28.39, "text": "我们要严加防范啊。"}, {"start": 29.39, "end": 33.39, "text": "大哥,关张赵再是勇猛,也不过只带来两千多兵马。"}, {"start": 33.39, "end": 38.39, "text": "而我们有精兵数十万,哪怕一人吐口吐马,也能将他生生淹死了。"}, {"start": 41.39, "end": 47.39, "text": "关羽三日之内连斩严良文丑,连曹操对他,都又敬又慰。"}, {"start": 48.39, "end": 49.39, "text": "你们岂能轻视他?"}, {"start": 50.39, "end": 56.39, "text": "再者,刘备手下虽然只有两千多兵勇,可个个是身经百战的老兵啊。"}, {"start": 57.39, "end": 62.39, "text": "而你们呢,整日里吃酒赌博,有多少年没打仗了?"}, {"start": 65.76, "end": 70.76, "text": "主公说了,发往新野的粮草军械,都有我们供给。"}, {"start": 71.76, "end": 80.76, "text": "你们听着,发往新野的粮草军械,一定要两千人围堵,多一点都不给他,以提防他扩充军备。"}, {"start": 81.76, "end": 82.76, "text": "遵命。"}, {"start": 85.04, "end": 86.04, "text": "上将军,主公夫人有请。"}, {"start": 87.04, "end": 91.04, "text": "知道了,回禀夫人,我稍后就去见她。"}, {"start": 92.04, "end": 102.32, "text": "诺。"}, {"start": 102.32, "end": 104.32, "text": "你看,翻过这座山就是新野城了。"}, {"start": 105.32, "end": 109.32, "text": "新野城市虽不大,却是一座坚城,易守难攻。"}, {"start": 110.32, "end": 114.32, "text": "据荆州也不过百里,如有战事,半日即可相遇。"}, {"start": 115.32, "end": 119.32, "text": "我等能在新野住脚,全亏了景胜兄大人。"}, {"start": 120.32, "end": 122.32, "text": "从踏入荆乡地界我就看出来了。"}, {"start": 123.32, "end": 129.32, "text": "这里农田里稻谷丰盛,村庄里人丁兴满。"}, {"start": 129.32, "end": 133.32, "text": "与其他州郡相比,荆乡真是有天壤之别。"}, {"start": 137.32, "end": 142.32, "text": "是啊,副帅自领荆州后,就视荆乡为家了。"}, {"start": 143.32, "end": 147.32, "text": "他甚至把自己的坟岭都选好了,准备终老于此处。"}, {"start": 148.32, "end": 152.32, "text": "对了,还有一件事情,我要多谢公子。"}, {"start": 152.32, "end": 159.32, "text": "我听孙前说,他来拜见景胜兄之时,蔡茂将军曾经极力反对我们入驻荆州。"}, {"start": 160.32, "end": 161.32, "text": "多亏了公子说话。"}, {"start": 162.32, "end": 163.32, "text": "公子怎么了?"}, {"start": 164.32, "end": 171.61, "text": "草安有一天,我会死于蔡茂之手。"}, {"start": 172.61, "end": 177.61, "text": "皇叔有所不知,我虽为长子,生母却不幸遭亡。"}, {"start": 178.61, "end": 182.61, "text": "副帅自领荆州后,迎娶后母蔡氏,"}, {"start": 182.61, "end": 185.61, "text": "上下一子,就是昨日你所看见的刘从。"}, {"start": 186.61, "end": 188.61, "text": "刘从极受副帅的喜爱。"}, {"start": 189.61, "end": 195.61, "text": "蔡氏和她的弟弟蔡茂,多年来一直在劝父亲,立刘从为世子。"}, {"start": 196.61, "end": 199.61, "text": "蔡氏又是荆乡九郡最大的士族。"}, {"start": 200.61, "end": 204.61, "text": "副帅大部分兵马,都掌握在上将军蔡茂手里。"}, {"start": 205.61, "end": 208.61, "text": "说不定哪天夜里,我却会死于非命。"}, {"start": 208.61, "end": 219.31, "text": "不但如此,我甚至担心副帅百年之后,蔡茂还会废了刘从,自己做荆乡之主。"}, {"start": 220.31, "end": 225.31, "text": "皇叔啊,你可知道蔡茂为何极力反对你来荆州吗?"}, {"start": 226.31, "end": 227.31, "text": "就是怕你坏了她的大胆。"}, {"start": 228.31, "end": 236.4, "text": "废长立右,是曲乱之道。"}, {"start": 237.4, "end": 240.4, "text": "荆升兄如此贤明,岂能不查?"}, {"start": 241.4, "end": 244.4, "text": "副帅年事已高,已经管不住他。"}, {"start": 244.4, "end": 247.4, "text": "皇叔,小侄想求你一件事。"}, {"start": 248.4, "end": 249.4, "text": "公子请吩咐。"}, {"start": 250.4, "end": 253.4, "text": "听在副帅面前,为我善言尽居吧。"}, {"start": 255.78, "end": 259.78, "text": "承荆升兄大恩,我才借得荆州一脚。"}, {"start": 268.53, "end": 272.53, "text": "贵府的家事,论理,我是断断不敢插嘴的。"}, {"start": 273.53, "end": 274.53, "text": "我只能这么说。"}, {"start": 275.53, "end": 277.53, "text": "如果有一天,荆升兄大恩,"}, {"start": 277.53, "end": 281.45, "text": "他征求我的意思,我定然会向他尽监。"}, {"start": 282.45, "end": 283.45, "text": "多谢皇叔。"}, {"start": 284.45, "end": 285.45, "text": "不谢。"}, {"start": 286.45, "end": 292.81, "text": "我听说,刘备来到咱们荆州了。"}, {"start": 293.81, "end": 296.81, "text": "是,主公已准许他们驻扎心眼。"}, {"start": 297.81, "end": 301.81, "text": "刘备手下,是不是有几名汉将,厉害得紧?"}, {"start": 302.81, "end": 307.81, "text": "有三员汉将,他们的名字叫关羽,张飞,"}, {"start": 307.81, "end": 308.81, "text": "赵云。"}, {"start": 309.81, "end": 312.81, "text": "主公已经六十四岁了,身体不好。"}, {"start": 315.92, "end": 320.92, "text": "我担心,万一主公有个三长两短,"}, {"start": 321.92, "end": 325.92, "text": "咱们荆州的这份家业,可不要落到别人手里去了。"}, {"start": 327.92, "end": 330.92, "text": "请姐姐放心,我早有防备。"}, {"start": 331.92, "end": 332.92, "text": "刘备他们翻不了天。"}, {"start": 333.92, "end": 334.92, "text": "除此之外,"}, {"start": 334.92, "end": 336.92, "text": "我还有一个心愿,你应该知道。"}, {"start": 337.92, "end": 341.77, "text": "知道。"}, {"start": 342.77, "end": 346.77, "text": "姐姐一直希望主公能把二公子刘从立为世子。"}, {"start": 347.77, "end": 351.77, "text": "不过这心愿嘛,还须从容行事才好。"}, {"start": 352.77, "end": 354.77, "text": "还是在意着点吧。"}, {"start": 355.77, "end": 359.77, "text": "千万别让刘备参与了咱们荆州的内政。"}, {"start": 360.77, "end": 363.77, "text": "更不能让刘备参与荆州的内政。"}, {"start": 363.77, "end": 364.77, "text": "知道了。"}, {"start": 364.77, "end": 369.77, "text": "建安十一年,曹操再次击败袁绍残部,"}, {"start": 370.77, "end": 373.77, "text": "相继宫去寄清并幽等州。"}, {"start": 374.77, "end": 378.77, "text": "袁绍与悲愤中吐血暴亡。"}, {"start": 379.77, "end": 386.77, "text": "至此,曹操取代袁绍成为大汉天地间最强盛的军夫。"}, {"start": 386.77, "end": 387.77, "text": "曹二蛮。"}, {"start": 388.77, "end": 389.77, "text": "曹二蛮。"}, {"start": 391.77, "end": 394.77, "text": "如等可进得了这荆州城湖。"}, {"start": 399.78, "end": 416.1, "text": "要是没有你许忧,我们当然进不了荆州城了。"}, {"start": 418.1, "end": 419.1, "text": "二蛮。"}, {"start": 420.1, "end": 421.1, "text": "二蛮。"}, {"start": 422.1, "end": 423.1, "text": "二蛮。"}, {"start": 424.1, "end": 425.1, "text": "二蛮。"}, {"start": 426.1, "end": 427.1, "text": "二蛮。"}, {"start": 428.1, "end": 429.1, "text": "二蛮。"}, {"start": 429.1, "end": 433.3, "text": "二蛮。"}, {"start": 434.3, "end": 435.3, "text": "如。"}, {"start": 436.3, "end": 439.3, "text": "可不能忘了我的大功啊。"}, {"start": 440.3, "end": 441.3, "text": "当然。"}, {"start": 441.3, "end": 445.3, "text": "先生的无嘲之功,我等岂敢忘记。"}, {"start": 446.3, "end": 467.8, "text": "诸位,不要看这曹二蛮今天是如何的得意。"}, {"start": 468.8, "end": 473.8, "text": "威风凛凛,当初那是跟我一块混日子的。"}, {"start": 473.8, "end": 480.8, "text": "我俩小的时候,在一起偷鸡摸鸡,独酒变酒。"}, {"start": 485.3, "end": 490.3, "text": "那段时光是何等的潇洒,何等的快活啊。"}, {"start": 491.3, "end": 495.3, "text": "二蛮啊,我说的事也不知啊。"}, {"start": 496.3, "end": 498.77, "text": "二蛮。"}, {"start": 498.77, "end": 502.42, "text": "二蛮到哪儿去了?"}, {"start": 503.42, "end": 506.42, "text": "快,如等快把曹二蛮给我找来。"}, {"start": 506.42, "end": 509.42, "text": "先生千万不可乱言,当心传到丞相罗里。"}, {"start": 510.42, "end": 512.42, "text": "什么丞相不丞相。"}, {"start": 513.42, "end": 516.42, "text": "阿蛮就是阿蛮,小混混的。"}, {"start": 517.42, "end": 518.42, "text": "跟我和你都一样。"}, {"start": 519.42, "end": 521.42, "text": "一个鼻子,两个眼睛。"}, {"start": 522.42, "end": 526.42, "text": "也难怪,儿等既非阿蛮故郊,又非读书之人。"}, {"start": 527.42, "end": 530.42, "text": "安置这天下的宜温去世啊。"}, {"start": 531.42, "end": 535.86, "text": "对了,对了,阿蛮啊。"}, {"start": 536.86, "end": 540.86, "text": "还有一个,你我不及之常,谈色。"}, {"start": 541.86, "end": 544.86, "text": "谈色啊,而且与众不同。"}, {"start": 545.86, "end": 549.86, "text": "了得,你我众所不及,独有其道啊。"}, {"start": 549.86, "end": 550.86, "text": "匹夫。"}, {"start": 551.86, "end": 556.86, "text": "卢氏何人,豪声大胆,胆敢惊了我的作计。"}, {"start": 557.86, "end": 560.37, "text": "你可知道我是谁?"}, {"start": 561.37, "end": 565.37, "text": "我乃丞相故郊,徐子远事业。"}, {"start": 566.37, "end": 570.37, "text": "你这么一个狗东西,你怎么也配姓徐?"}, {"start": 571.37, "end": 572.37, "text": "配姓徐?"}, {"start": 573.37, "end": 578.67, "text": "徐子远,徐子远。"}, {"start": 578.67, "end": 582.4, "text": "你怎么也配姓徐?"}, {"start": 584.94, "end": 586.94, "text": "配姓徐?"}, {"start": 587.94, "end": 589.94, "text": "去问问你家丞相曹阿蛮,"}, {"start": 590.94, "end": 592.94, "text": "若是没有我这个姓徐的,"}, {"start": 593.94, "end": 598.94, "text": "儿等这帮匹夫粗汉,俺能进得了这济州城。"}, {"start": 600.94, "end": 603.94, "text": "你给我听好了,你在胡言乱语。"}, {"start": 604.94, "end": 607.82, "text": "我砍了你。"}, {"start": 607.82, "end": 608.82, "text": "也罢。"}, {"start": 609.82, "end": 613.82, "text": "儿等这些粗汉痴,"}, {"start": 614.82, "end": 620.82, "text": "奄能之小,姓氏之来有,名字之来厉乎。"}, {"start": 622.82, "end": 623.82, "text": "不要说你,匹夫。"}, {"start": 624.82, "end": 627.82, "text": "把你家丞相叫来,不敬我一尺。"}, {"start": 628.82, "end": 632.23, "text": "也得让我三分。"}, {"start": 633.23, "end": 635.23, "text": "你不是就想要许有这颗头吗?"}, {"start": 635.23, "end": 637.23, "text": "今天姓徐的就把脖子给你伸到那儿。"}, {"start": 638.23, "end": 640.23, "text": "匹夫,有本事,你就砍了去。"}, {"start": 641.23, "end": 642.23, "text": "到你家丞相阿蛮那儿去秦宫。"}, {"start": 643.23, "end": 644.23, "text": "砍!"}, {"start": 644.23, "end": 645.23, "text": "有种的砍嘛!"}, {"start": 646.23, "end": 647.23, "text": "砍呀!"}, {"start": 648.23, "end": 649.23, "text": "谅你也没这个胆。"}, {"start": 652.23, "end": 657.02, "text": "好一座雄伟壮丽的济州府,"}, {"start": 658.02, "end": 661.65, "text": "竟然比洛阳海稍胜一筹。"}, {"start": 698.65, "end": 700.65, "text": "袁绍拥有这等城市,"}, {"start": 700.65, "end": 701.65, "text": "实在是太可惜了。"}, {"start": 703.65, "end": 705.65, "text": "孩儿听说袁绍在建济州时,"}, {"start": 706.65, "end": 708.65, "text": "有意要把他建成天下首府啊。"}, {"start": 709.65, "end": 710.65, "text": "我现在算是明白,"}, {"start": 710.65, "end": 713.65, "text": "为什么那些文人默客都喜欢投奔袁绍了。"}, {"start": 714.65, "end": 715.65, "text": "因为他房子大!"}, {"start": 718.65, "end": 720.65, "text": "济州这个地方先后出过四大之势,"}, {"start": 721.65, "end": 722.65, "text": "包括陈林等等。"}, {"start": 723.65, "end": 724.65, "text": "陈林?"}, {"start": 725.65, "end": 726.65, "text": "陈林?"}, {"start": 726.65, "end": 727.65, "text": "就是那个写讨贼细闻的陈林?"}, {"start": 728.65, "end": 729.65, "text": "正是。"}, {"start": 729.65, "end": 730.65, "text": "立刻拿他!"}, {"start": 730.65, "end": 731.65, "text": "遵命!"}, {"start": 731.65, "end": 733.65, "text": "丞相,陈林押来了。"}, {"start": 734.65, "end": 735.65, "text": "你就是陈林?"}, {"start": 736.65, "end": 737.65, "text": "是。"}, {"start": 754.97, "end": 763.06, "text": "你把我骂得惊天动地,"}, {"start": 763.06, "end": 765.06, "text": "珊瑚海啸,"}, {"start": 770.66, "end": 771.66, "text": "狗血淋头,"}, {"start": 771.66, "end": 773.66, "text": "叫我听得好享受啊。"}, {"start": 775.66, "end": 776.66, "text": "今日,"}, {"start": 776.66, "end": 781.26, "text": "我和袁绍拥有一个新闻,"}, {"start": 781.26, "end": 782.26, "text": "你怎么不骂了?"}, {"start": 783.26, "end": 784.26, "text": "我告诉你,"}, {"start": 785.26, "end": 786.26, "text": "人呐,"}, {"start": 787.26, "end": 788.26, "text": "骂,"}, {"start": 788.26, "end": 794.82, "text": "是骂不到的。"}, {"start": 795.82, "end": 796.82, "text": "欲满天下者,"}, {"start": 797.82, "end": 798.82, "text": "往往也是,"}, {"start": 799.82, "end": 800.82, "text": "毁满天下。"}, {"start": 800.82, "end": 802.82, "text": "丞相说得好。"}, {"start": 802.82, "end": 803.82, "text": "你抬起头来,"}, {"start": 804.82, "end": 805.82, "text": "看着我,"}, {"start": 805.82, "end": 807.82, "text": "你看我这份气色,"}, {"start": 807.82, "end": 810.62, "text": "这份精神头,"}, {"start": 810.62, "end": 815.21, "text": "那都是叫人给骂出来的。"}, {"start": 819.02, "end": 820.02, "text": "我告诉你,"}, {"start": 820.02, "end": 821.02, "text": "那天晚上,"}, {"start": 821.02, "end": 823.02, "text": "我头痛发作,"}, {"start": 823.02, "end": 825.02, "text": "痛不可当。"}, {"start": 825.02, "end": 827.02, "text": "但是我读了你的讨贼稀文,"}, {"start": 827.02, "end": 829.02, "text": "我的头痛立刻就好了,"}, {"start": 829.02, "end": 830.02, "text": "不要而愈。"}, {"start": 831.02, "end": 833.02, "text": "但是我又一世不明。"}, {"start": 834.02, "end": 835.02, "text": "你骂我也就罢了,"}, {"start": 835.02, "end": 839.02, "text": "为什么要把曹操的祖宗三代都烧上了?"}, {"start": 840.02, "end": 842.02, "text": "他们与你何干?"}, {"start": 842.02, "end": 843.02, "text": "禀丞相,"}, {"start": 844.02, "end": 845.02, "text": "那时候,"}, {"start": 845.02, "end": 850.2, "text": "我和袁绍拥有一个新闻,"}, {"start": 850.2, "end": 851.2, "text": "丞相,"}, {"start": 852.2, "end": 854.2, "text": "那时候罪臣身为袁绍牧兵,"}, {"start": 854.2, "end": 856.2, "text": "受命撰写讨贼稀文,"}, {"start": 856.2, "end": 857.2, "text": "所以,"}, {"start": 857.2, "end": 859.2, "text": "不得不以笔为刀,"}, {"start": 859.2, "end": 861.2, "text": "痛下狠手。"}, {"start": 862.2, "end": 863.2, "text": "罪臣,"}, {"start": 864.2, "end": 865.2, "text": "请丞相赐罪。"}, {"start": 865.2, "end": 867.2, "text": "以笔为刀,"}, {"start": 867.2, "end": 870.2, "text": "岂止是以笔作刀啊。"}, {"start": 870.2, "end": 871.2, "text": "你的一支笔,"}, {"start": 871.2, "end": 872.2, "text": "抵得上十万大军,"}, {"start": 872.2, "end": 873.2, "text": "你知道吗?"}, {"start": 875.2, "end": 876.2, "text": "陈林,"}, {"start": 876.2, "end": 877.2, "text": "起来吧。"}, {"start": 877.2, "end": 878.2, "text": "谢丞相。"}, {"start": 878.2, "end": 884.2, "text": "当初我读你的大作的时候,"}, {"start": 884.2, "end": 886.2, "text": "就对你是又恨又气,"}, {"start": 886.2, "end": 888.2, "text": "又喜又爱。"}, {"start": 889.2, "end": 892.2, "text": "今天我坐在袁绍的王座上,"}, {"start": 893.2, "end": 896.2, "text": "自然对你是更要刮目相看了。"}, {"start": 896.2, "end": 901.14, "text": "你的才气,"}, {"start": 901.14, "end": 903.14, "text": "是既逼人,"}, {"start": 903.14, "end": 904.14, "text": "又喜人。"}, {"start": 905.14, "end": 906.14, "text": "今后,"}, {"start": 906.14, "end": 907.14, "text": "执政,"}, {"start": 908.14, "end": 909.14, "text": "御民,"}, {"start": 909.14, "end": 910.14, "text": "清史,"}, {"start": 910.14, "end": 911.14, "text": "丹书,"}, {"start": 911.14, "end": 913.14, "text": "都少不了你这样的人才。"}, {"start": 913.14, "end": 914.14, "text": "当然,"}, {"start": 915.14, "end": 917.14, "text": "如果你要是不愿意做我的慕宾,"}, {"start": 918.14, "end": 920.14, "text": "我就赏你一座宅子,"}, {"start": 920.14, "end": 922.14, "text": "二十匹绸缎,"}, {"start": 922.14, "end": 924.14, "text": "你尽可以关起门来,"}, {"start": 924.14, "end": 925.14, "text": "阴风弄月,"}, {"start": 925.14, "end": 927.14, "text": "但是有个条件,"}, {"start": 927.14, "end": 929.14, "text": "写出了好诗文,"}, {"start": 929.14, "end": 931.14, "text": "第一个要送到我这儿,"}, {"start": 931.14, "end": 932.14, "text": "让我欣赏,"}, {"start": 932.14, "end": 934.14, "text": "我要先赌为快。"}, {"start": 934.14, "end": 935.14, "text": "你看可否?"}, {"start": 935.14, "end": 939.93, "text": "丞相恩威浩荡,"}, {"start": 939.93, "end": 941.93, "text": "古今难觅,"}, {"start": 941.93, "end": 944.93, "text": "罪臣愿意归乡丞相。"}, {"start": 944.93, "end": 945.93, "text": "丞相!"}, {"start": 946.93, "end": 947.93, "text": "这就对了!"}, {"start": 948.93, "end": 949.93, "text": "这就对了!"}, {"start": 950.93, "end": 951.93, "text": "起来!"}, {"start": 951.93, "end": 954.98, "text": "起来!"}, {"start": 954.98, "end": 959.53, "text": "丞相!"}, {"start": 964.27, "end": 965.27, "text": "你看看,"}, {"start": 965.27, "end": 966.27, "text": "你我之间,"}, {"start": 966.27, "end": 968.27, "text": "还骂出一份交情。"}, {"start": 970.27, "end": 971.27, "text": "今日我,"}, {"start": 971.27, "end": 972.27, "text": "甚是快活。"}, {"start": 976.34, "end": 977.34, "text": "你先去吧,"}, {"start": 977.34, "end": 978.34, "text": "我们回头聊。"}, {"start": 979.34, "end": 980.34, "text": "罪臣告退。"}, {"start": 980.34, "end": 993.22, "text": "这是什么?"}, {"start": 993.22, "end": 995.22, "text": "这是从袁绍内府中,"}, {"start": 995.22, "end": 997.22, "text": "搜出来的书信。"}, {"start": 998.22, "end": 1000.22, "text": "都是谁写给袁绍的?"}, {"start": 1001.22, "end": 1002.22, "text": "在下,"}, {"start": 1002.22, "end": 1003.22, "text": "不好说。"}, {"start": 1003.22, "end": 1006.58, "text": "你看看。"}, {"start": 1028.51, "end": 1029.51, "text": "父亲,"}, {"start": 1029.51, "end": 1030.51, "text": "这些大都是,"}, {"start": 1030.51, "end": 1034.37, "text": "直说无妨。"}, {"start": 1034.37, "end": 1049.2, "text": "这些都是我方的文武官吏,"}, {"start": 1049.2, "end": 1051.2, "text": "写给袁绍的信。"}, {"start": 1051.2, "end": 1053.2, "text": "他们早在建安初年,"}, {"start": 1053.2, "end": 1054.2, "text": "就暗通袁绍了。"}, {"start": 1054.2, "end": 1066.62, "text": "不看了。"}, {"start": 1067.62, "end": 1068.62, "text": "看了生气。"}, {"start": 1069.62, "end": 1074.85, "text": "父亲,"}, {"start": 1074.85, "end": 1076.85, "text": "他们拿着我们的俸禄,"}, {"start": 1076.85, "end": 1078.85, "text": "饱受着父亲的恩宠,"}, {"start": 1078.85, "end": 1080.85, "text": "暗地里却备逐同贼。"}, {"start": 1080.85, "end": 1082.85, "text": "现在罪证确凿了。"}, {"start": 1082.85, "end": 1084.85, "text": "我们只要依着性命抓捕,"}, {"start": 1084.85, "end": 1086.85, "text": "他们一个都跑不了。"}, {"start": 1086.85, "end": 1092.82, "text": "他们自然是逃不掉的,"}, {"start": 1092.82, "end": 1094.82, "text": "但是抓住又能怎么样呢?"}, {"start": 1095.82, "end": 1096.82, "text": "斩。"}, {"start": 1096.82, "end": 1097.82, "text": "斩?"}, {"start": 1097.82, "end": 1103.24, "text": "那是不是,"}, {"start": 1103.24, "end": 1105.24, "text": "应该把我也斩了呀?"}, {"start": 1105.24, "end": 1108.24, "text": "因为我也跟袁绍通过书信,"}, {"start": 1108.24, "end": 1111.24, "text": "而且我还拍过他的马屁。"}, {"start": 1111.24, "end": 1112.24, "text": "我说他是,"}, {"start": 1112.24, "end": 1116.22, "text": "南天一柱,"}, {"start": 1116.22, "end": 1118.22, "text": "万世楷模。"}, {"start": 1120.22, "end": 1121.22, "text": "我况且如此,"}, {"start": 1121.22, "end": 1122.22, "text": "更何况他们,"}, {"start": 1123.22, "end": 1124.22, "text": "可以理解。"}, {"start": 1125.22, "end": 1127.22, "text": "他们是怕我战败了,"}, {"start": 1127.22, "end": 1129.22, "text": "想给自己留条后路。"}, {"start": 1129.22, "end": 1130.22, "text": "丞相明鉴,"}, {"start": 1130.22, "end": 1136.97, "text": "当年袁绍势力滔天,"}, {"start": 1136.97, "end": 1138.97, "text": "但仍非丞相对手。"}, {"start": 1138.97, "end": 1141.97, "text": "如今袁绍命归九泉,"}, {"start": 1141.97, "end": 1143.97, "text": "这区区书信,"}, {"start": 1143.97, "end": 1144.97, "text": "更谈合法。"}, {"start": 1145.97, "end": 1147.97, "text": "丞相不如烧死书简,"}, {"start": 1147.97, "end": 1149.97, "text": "已是对老友相送。"}, {"start": 1150.97, "end": 1153.79, "text": "你看看,"}, {"start": 1154.79, "end": 1156.79, "text": "寻衣是何等胸怀?"}, {"start": 1158.79, "end": 1160.79, "text": "在下不敢当,"}, {"start": 1161.79, "end": 1163.79, "text": "丞相胸怀远大,"}, {"start": 1164.79, "end": 1167.79, "text": "在下只是说了句丞相想说的话。"}, {"start": 1168.79, "end": 1169.79, "text": "皮儿,"}, {"start": 1169.79, "end": 1174.62, "text": "你把这些书信拿到正阳门外,"}, {"start": 1174.62, "end": 1177.62, "text": "当着文武百官的面,"}, {"start": 1177.62, "end": 1178.62, "text": "一把火焚尽,"}, {"start": 1178.62, "end": 1180.62, "text": "并且告诉他们,"}, {"start": 1180.62, "end": 1182.62, "text": "既往之势,"}, {"start": 1182.62, "end": 1183.62, "text": "永不察觉。"}, {"start": 1184.62, "end": 1188.02, "text": "遵命。"}, {"start": 1188.02, "end": 1226.17, "text": "徐叔,"}, {"start": 1226.17, "end": 1227.17, "text": "你又闯祸了。"}, {"start": 1228.17, "end": 1231.51, "text": "徐悠在大庭广众之下,"}, {"start": 1231.51, "end": 1232.51, "text": "侮辱主公,"}, {"start": 1232.51, "end": 1233.51, "text": "我离他住口,"}, {"start": 1233.51, "end": 1235.51, "text": "这小子竟然把头伸回来,"}, {"start": 1235.51, "end": 1236.51, "text": "让我砍他。"}, {"start": 1236.51, "end": 1237.51, "text": "如果我不砍他,"}, {"start": 1237.51, "end": 1238.51, "text": "我就成他孙子了。"}, {"start": 1239.51, "end": 1240.51, "text": "我一怒之下,"}, {"start": 1240.51, "end": 1241.51, "text": "就砍了这颗狗头。"}, {"start": 1242.51, "end": 1253.88, "text": "你把徐悠砍了?"}, {"start": 1254.88, "end": 1260.21, "text": "徐悠是我多年的好友,"}, {"start": 1260.21, "end": 1262.21, "text": "咱们破元少曲季州他立了头功,"}, {"start": 1262.21, "end": 1263.21, "text": "你把他砍了?"}, {"start": 1263.21, "end": 1264.21, "text": "我陪他一个人走就是了。"}, {"start": 1264.21, "end": 1265.21, "text": "说得好,"}, {"start": 1265.21, "end": 1266.21, "text": "把徐叔给我推出去,"}, {"start": 1266.21, "end": 1268.21, "text": "斩首示众。"}, {"start": 1268.21, "end": 1269.21, "text": "遵命。"}, {"start": 1269.21, "end": 1270.21, "text": "徐叔他,"}, {"start": 1270.21, "end": 1271.21, "text": "九星沙场,"}, {"start": 1271.21, "end": 1272.21, "text": "履历战功啊,"}, {"start": 1272.21, "end": 1273.21, "text": "父亲饶恕他吧。"}, {"start": 1273.21, "end": 1274.21, "text": "不成,"}, {"start": 1275.21, "end": 1276.21, "text": "军法难容,"}, {"start": 1276.21, "end": 1277.21, "text": "他砍了徐悠,"}, {"start": 1277.21, "end": 1278.21, "text": "更是天理难容,"}, {"start": 1278.21, "end": 1279.21, "text": "给我把他推出去,"}, {"start": 1279.21, "end": 1280.21, "text": "斩了。"}, {"start": 1280.21, "end": 1281.21, "text": "丞相,"}, {"start": 1281.21, "end": 1282.21, "text": "父亲,"}, {"start": 1282.21, "end": 1283.21, "text": "他是一身冲动啊,父亲。"}, {"start": 1283.21, "end": 1284.21, "text": "我不能一身冲动,"}, {"start": 1284.21, "end": 1285.21, "text": "我早就要栽他。"}, {"start": 1286.21, "end": 1287.21, "text": "反了,"}, {"start": 1287.21, "end": 1288.21, "text": "反了,"}, {"start": 1288.21, "end": 1289.21, "text": "反了,"}, {"start": 1289.21, "end": 1290.21, "text": "给我推出去,"}, {"start": 1290.21, "end": 1291.21, "text": "推出去,"}, {"start": 1291.21, "end": 1292.21, "text": "砍了。"}, {"start": 1293.21, "end": 1294.21, "text": "丞相,"}, {"start": 1294.21, "end": 1297.21, "text": "徐楚确实有罪,"}, {"start": 1297.21, "end": 1300.21, "text": "但徐悠在成关前狂妄叫嚣,"}, {"start": 1300.21, "end": 1303.21, "text": "在下也是亲耳听到过,"}, {"start": 1303.21, "end": 1306.21, "text": "的确如丞相太慎,"}, {"start": 1306.21, "end": 1309.21, "text": "在下建议厚葬徐悠,"}, {"start": 1309.21, "end": 1310.21, "text": "表奏天子,"}, {"start": 1310.21, "end": 1312.21, "text": "追封徐悠为当阳侯,"}, {"start": 1312.21, "end": 1314.21, "text": "同时严惩徐楚,"}, {"start": 1314.21, "end": 1318.21, "text": "令徐楚在徐悠坟前叩首认罪。"}, {"start": 1318.21, "end": 1334.1, "text": "徐悠给咱们立了大功,"}, {"start": 1334.1, "end": 1336.1, "text": "咱们才刚刚进城,"}, {"start": 1336.1, "end": 1338.1, "text": "我就把他杀了。"}, {"start": 1338.1, "end": 1341.1, "text": "天下的人会怎么想我,"}, {"start": 1341.1, "end": 1343.1, "text": "他们会觉得我心胸狭隘,"}, {"start": 1343.1, "end": 1345.1, "text": "人家刚说了我几句,"}, {"start": 1345.1, "end": 1347.1, "text": "我就招人把他杀了。"}, {"start": 1347.1, "end": 1351.1, "text": "世人断不会这样揣想,"}, {"start": 1351.1, "end": 1354.1, "text": "因为徐悠满口胡言,"}, {"start": 1354.1, "end": 1356.1, "text": "实是无中生有,"}, {"start": 1356.1, "end": 1358.1, "text": "痴人说梦。"}, {"start": 1358.1, "end": 1360.1, "text": "那你怎么才能证明他是"}, {"start": 1360.1, "end": 1361.1, "text": "满口胡言,"}, {"start": 1361.1, "end": 1362.1, "text": "痴人说梦呢?"}, {"start": 1362.1, "end": 1365.1, "text": "在下请才士们写篇奏文,"}, {"start": 1365.1, "end": 1367.1, "text": "为丞相歌功颂德,"}, {"start": 1367.1, "end": 1368.1, "text": "不吃许用。"}, {"start": 1368.1, "end": 1370.1, "text": "另外,"}, {"start": 1370.1, "end": 1371.1, "text": "这篇奏文,"}, {"start": 1371.1, "end": 1373.1, "text": "就请陈琳来撰写"}, {"start": 1373.1, "end": 1374.1, "text": "是最为合适,"}, {"start": 1374.1, "end": 1376.1, "text": "她的如船之笔,"}, {"start": 1376.1, "end": 1378.1, "text": "堪称尚佳,"}, {"start": 1378.1, "end": 1380.1, "text": "文章奏成以后,"}, {"start": 1380.1, "end": 1381.1, "text": "定能像当年的"}, {"start": 1381.1, "end": 1382.1, "text": "讨贼习文一样,"}, {"start": 1382.1, "end": 1384.1, "text": "令海内外传送。"}, {"start": 1384.1, "end": 1387.1, "text": "那要是陈琳清高不愿意写呢?"}, {"start": 1387.1, "end": 1389.1, "text": "在下前去拜访,"}, {"start": 1389.1, "end": 1391.1, "text": "当面说服陈琳,"}, {"start": 1401.58, "end": 1402.58, "text": "徐初,"}, {"start": 1402.58, "end": 1404.58, "text": "你杀了我多年好友,"}, {"start": 1404.58, "end": 1406.58, "text": "原本罪不可恕,"}, {"start": 1406.58, "end": 1408.58, "text": "但是我念你,"}, {"start": 1408.58, "end": 1411.58, "text": "醉酒过失,"}, {"start": 1411.58, "end": 1413.58, "text": "就饶你不死,"}, {"start": 1413.58, "end": 1415.58, "text": "但是从即日起,"}, {"start": 1415.58, "end": 1417.58, "text": "降违不足,"}, {"start": 1417.58, "end": 1419.58, "text": "你去养马吧,"}, {"start": 1419.58, "end": 1421.58, "text": "还有三个月之内,"}, {"start": 1421.58, "end": 1423.58, "text": "不许喝酒,"}, {"start": 1423.58, "end": 1427.85, "text": "你得去许忧的坟头,"}, {"start": 1427.85, "end": 1429.85, "text": "给他磕头,"}, {"start": 1429.85, "end": 1434.5, "text": "快写吧,"}, {"start": 1435.5, "end": 1436.5, "text": "快啊,"}, {"start": 1436.5, "end": 1437.5, "text": "快走啊,"}, {"start": 1437.5, "end": 1443.9, "text": "醉将谢恩,"}, {"start": 1443.9, "end": 1447.85, "text": "滚吧,"}, {"start": 1447.85, "end": 1453.55, "text": "徐先生,"}, {"start": 1453.55, "end": 1456.38, "text": "先生,"}, {"start": 1456.38, "end": 1462.73, "text": "多谢开言相救,"}, {"start": 1462.73, "end": 1464.73, "text": "不必客气了,"}, {"start": 1465.73, "end": 1466.73, "text": "先生,"}, {"start": 1466.73, "end": 1468.73, "text": "刚才在堂上,"}, {"start": 1468.73, "end": 1469.73, "text": "有一件事,"}, {"start": 1469.73, "end": 1471.73, "text": "让我好生糊涂,"}, {"start": 1471.73, "end": 1476.32, "text": "你有什么糊涂的?"}, {"start": 1476.32, "end": 1477.32, "text": "你看啊,"}, {"start": 1477.32, "end": 1479.32, "text": "曹匹公子为我求情,"}, {"start": 1479.32, "end": 1480.32, "text": "这人都跪下了,"}, {"start": 1480.32, "end": 1481.32, "text": "主公就是不准,"}, {"start": 1481.32, "end": 1483.32, "text": "可是你一求情,"}, {"start": 1483.32, "end": 1484.32, "text": "主公就准了,"}, {"start": 1484.32, "end": 1485.32, "text": "你这是为何?"}, {"start": 1486.32, "end": 1487.32, "text": "世子年轻,"}, {"start": 1487.32, "end": 1489.32, "text": "不知道哪句话,"}, {"start": 1489.32, "end": 1491.32, "text": "才能说到丞相的心里去,"}, {"start": 1491.32, "end": 1492.32, "text": "我老了,"}, {"start": 1492.32, "end": 1494.32, "text": "略知一点,"}, {"start": 1494.32, "end": 1495.32, "text": "太好了,"}, {"start": 1495.32, "end": 1498.72, "text": "先生,"}, {"start": 1499.72, "end": 1501.72, "text": "你再替我求情,"}, {"start": 1502.72, "end": 1504.72, "text": "你又惹什么祸了?"}, {"start": 1504.72, "end": 1505.72, "text": "没有,"}, {"start": 1505.72, "end": 1509.22, "text": "喝酒的事,"}, {"start": 1509.22, "end": 1510.22, "text": "你看啊,"}, {"start": 1510.22, "end": 1512.22, "text": "主公让我当部族,"}, {"start": 1512.22, "end": 1514.22, "text": "做马夫怎么都成,"}, {"start": 1514.22, "end": 1515.22, "text": "就连给那个许忧客,"}, {"start": 1515.22, "end": 1516.22, "text": "一百个头我都忍,"}, {"start": 1516.22, "end": 1517.22, "text": "你是不让喝酒,"}, {"start": 1518.22, "end": 1520.22, "text": "足足三个月啊,"}, {"start": 1520.22, "end": 1522.22, "text": "非把我憋死不堪吗?"}, {"start": 1528.22, "end": 1530.22, "text": "你真是得寸进尸,"}, {"start": 1533.78, "end": 1534.78, "text": "这个情啊,"}, {"start": 1534.78, "end": 1535.78, "text": "我不求,"}, {"start": 1535.78, "end": 1536.78, "text": "别别别,"}, {"start": 1536.78, "end": 1537.78, "text": "先生,"}, {"start": 1538.78, "end": 1540.78, "text": "救人救到底,"}, {"start": 1540.78, "end": 1542.78, "text": "你要是帮这大王,"}, {"start": 1542.78, "end": 1543.78, "text": "许主这辈子,"}, {"start": 1543.78, "end": 1545.78, "text": "都感谢你的大恩,"}, {"start": 1545.78, "end": 1546.78, "text": "什么心思?"}, {"start": 1546.78, "end": 1549.64, "text": "我告诉你,"}, {"start": 1552.59, "end": 1555.59, "text": "你是丞相最喜欢的战将,"}, {"start": 1555.59, "end": 1557.59, "text": "你今天做了一件,"}, {"start": 1557.59, "end": 1558.59, "text": "丞相想做,"}, {"start": 1558.59, "end": 1560.59, "text": "而不敢做的事情,"}, {"start": 1560.59, "end": 1561.59, "text": "杀许诺,"}, {"start": 1562.59, "end": 1564.59, "text": "丞相气你是假,"}, {"start": 1564.59, "end": 1566.59, "text": "爱你才是真,"}, {"start": 1566.59, "end": 1567.59, "text": "怎么就没看出来呢,"}, {"start": 1567.59, "end": 1568.59, "text": "你说,"}, {"start": 1568.59, "end": 1570.59, "text": "你要是看出来了,"}, {"start": 1570.59, "end": 1572.59, "text": "你还是决定杀了他吧,"}, {"start": 1572.59, "end": 1573.59, "text": "是,"}, {"start": 1573.59, "end": 1574.59, "text": "是,"}, {"start": 1574.59, "end": 1582.12, "text": "是,"}, {"start": 1582.12, "end": 1583.12, "text": "是,"}, {"start": 1583.12, "end": 1584.12, "text": "是,"}, {"start": 1584.12, "end": 1585.12, "text": "要是看出来了,"}, {"start": 1585.12, "end": 1587.12, "text": "你还是局除骂,"}, {"start": 1587.12, "end": 1589.12, "text": "丞相之所以罚你做马夫,"}, {"start": 1589.12, "end": 1591.12, "text": "之所以罚你进京,"}, {"start": 1591.12, "end": 1594.12, "text": "都是为了磨练你的性子,"}, {"start": 1595.12, "end": 1597.12, "text": "丞相想把你培养成为,"}, {"start": 1597.12, "end": 1599.12, "text": "三军主将,"}, {"start": 1599.12, "end": 1608.12, "text": "怎么样,"}, {"start": 1609.12, "end": 1611.12, "text": "还让我替你去求情吗?"}, {"start": 1611.12, "end": 1617.88, "text": "我,"}, {"start": 1617.88, "end": 1642.53, "text": "我为马权,"}, {"start": 1642.53, "end": 1643.53, "text": "天下九州,"}, {"start": 1643.53, "end": 1645.53, "text": "大半已收入父亲当中,"}, {"start": 1645.53, "end": 1647.53, "text": "现在只剩下,"}, {"start": 1647.53, "end": 1648.53, "text": "刘表,"}, {"start": 1648.53, "end": 1649.53, "text": "刘彰,"}, {"start": 1649.53, "end": 1650.53, "text": "孙全等辈了,"}, {"start": 1659.11, "end": 1660.11, "text": "刘表啊,"}, {"start": 1660.11, "end": 1661.11, "text": "陆路无为,"}, {"start": 1661.11, "end": 1663.11, "text": "不过是个守称之辈,"}, {"start": 1663.11, "end": 1665.11, "text": "今周早晚是我的,"}, {"start": 1666.11, "end": 1668.11, "text": "刘彰就不用说了,"}, {"start": 1668.11, "end": 1671.65, "text": "孙全,"}, {"start": 1671.65, "end": 1673.65, "text": "如秀未干,"}, {"start": 1673.65, "end": 1675.65, "text": "兵少将寡,"}, {"start": 1675.65, "end": 1676.65, "text": "不足为虑,"}, {"start": 1676.65, "end": 1679.47, "text": "刘辈呢,"}, {"start": 1679.47, "end": 1681.47, "text": "刘辈在哪儿?"}, {"start": 1682.47, "end": 1684.47, "text": "刘辈投奔刘表之后,"}, {"start": 1685.47, "end": 1688.47, "text": "已在小城心野诸君,"}, {"start": 1688.47, "end": 1689.47, "text": "此城,"}, {"start": 1689.47, "end": 1691.47, "text": "地不到百里,"}, {"start": 1691.47, "end": 1693.47, "text": "兵不足三千,"}, {"start": 1693.47, "end": 1694.47, "text": "因此,"}, {"start": 1694.47, "end": 1696.47, "text": "就没标赏,"}, {"start": 1696.47, "end": 1698.47, "text": "刘辈不出,"}, {"start": 1698.47, "end": 1702.78, "text": "终是祸患,"}, {"start": 1702.78, "end": 1703.78, "text": "父亲,"}, {"start": 1703.78, "end": 1705.78, "text": "袁绍死后,"}, {"start": 1705.78, "end": 1707.78, "text": "我们军事大赈,"}, {"start": 1707.78, "end": 1709.78, "text": "现有部军三十万,"}, {"start": 1709.78, "end": 1710.78, "text": "马军十五万,"}, {"start": 1710.78, "end": 1711.78, "text": "水军二十万,"}, {"start": 1711.78, "end": 1713.78, "text": "总计六十五万,"}, {"start": 1713.78, "end": 1716.78, "text": "其他各路诸侯加到一块,"}, {"start": 1716.78, "end": 1718.78, "text": "也不如我军的一半呢,"}, {"start": 1719.78, "end": 1721.78, "text": "先让三军修整一年,"}, {"start": 1721.78, "end": 1722.78, "text": "立兵莫马,"}, {"start": 1722.78, "end": 1724.78, "text": "储备粮草兵器,"}, {"start": 1724.78, "end": 1725.78, "text": "之后,"}, {"start": 1725.78, "end": 1727.78, "text": "我要一鼓作气,"}, {"start": 1727.78, "end": 1729.78, "text": "一统天下,"}, {"start": 1729.78, "end": 1760.42, "text": "曹操决开张河,"}, {"start": 1760.42, "end": 1763.42, "text": "再次大破援兵,"}, {"start": 1763.42, "end": 1766.42, "text": "袁绍气得吐血暴亡了,"}, {"start": 1766.42, "end": 1770.85, "text": "袁潭,袁尚等公子,"}, {"start": 1770.85, "end": 1772.85, "text": "在大难临头时,"}, {"start": 1772.85, "end": 1774.85, "text": "仍在争夺世子之位,"}, {"start": 1774.85, "end": 1776.85, "text": "被曹操乘机猛攻,"}, {"start": 1776.85, "end": 1778.85, "text": "最后,"}, {"start": 1778.85, "end": 1780.85, "text": "几十万援兵残部"}, {"start": 1780.85, "end": 1782.85, "text": "全部被曹操歼灭了,"}, {"start": 1782.85, "end": 1787.25, "text": "袁氏二公子,"}, {"start": 1787.25, "end": 1789.25, "text": "他往辽东避难,"}, {"start": 1789.25, "end": 1791.25, "text": "又被辽东太守,"}, {"start": 1791.25, "end": 1793.25, "text": "攻孙康斩杀,"}, {"start": 1794.25, "end": 1796.25, "text": "二元受急,"}, {"start": 1796.25, "end": 1798.25, "text": "被当作礼物,"}, {"start": 1798.25, "end": 1800.25, "text": "送亡许诚,"}, {"start": 1800.25, "end": 1803.25, "text": "曹操陆续收取,"}, {"start": 1803.25, "end": 1805.25, "text": "寄星并邮各州,"}, {"start": 1805.25, "end": 1808.53, "text": "大半个天下,"}, {"start": 1808.53, "end": 1813.25, "text": "落入了曹操的鬼囊中了,"}, {"start": 1813.25, "end": 1818.9, "text": "曹操生事滔天哪,"}, {"start": 1818.9, "end": 1827.17, "text": "禀主公,"}, {"start": 1827.17, "end": 1829.17, "text": "刘表传话来,"}, {"start": 1829.17, "end": 1831.17, "text": "要主公前往京州共度端午佳节,"}, {"start": 1831.17, "end": 1853.1, "text": "请问,"}, {"start": 1853.1, "end": 1855.1, "text": "阁下是刘皇叔吗?"}, {"start": 1855.1, "end": 1857.1, "text": "正是在下,"}, {"start": 1857.1, "end": 1859.1, "text": "我是蔡氏,"}, {"start": 1859.1, "end": 1861.1, "text": "嫂夫人,"}, {"start": 1861.1, "end": 1865.02, "text": "在下失礼了,"}, {"start": 1865.02, "end": 1867.02, "text": "不必多礼,"}, {"start": 1867.02, "end": 1869.02, "text": "京州好吗?"}, {"start": 1869.02, "end": 1871.02, "text": "好,好,甚好,"}, {"start": 1871.02, "end": 1873.02, "text": "那你就多待些日子吧,"}, {"start": 1873.02, "end": 1891.5, "text": "莫非是要撵我走,"}, {"start": 1891.5, "end": 1893.5, "text": "皇叔,请进府吧,"}, {"start": 1893.5, "end": 1904.53, "text": "主公等候多时了,"}, {"start": 1904.53, "end": 1906.53, "text": "宣德,你胖了,"}, {"start": 1908.53, "end": 1910.53, "text": "气韵饱满,"}, {"start": 1910.53, "end": 1912.53, "text": "身形丰硕呀,"}, {"start": 1914.53, "end": 1916.53, "text": "明公啊,"}, {"start": 1916.53, "end": 1918.53, "text": "在下年近五十了,"}, {"start": 1920.53, "end": 1922.53, "text": "身无寸功,"}, {"start": 1922.53, "end": 1924.53, "text": "足无寸土,"}, {"start": 1924.53, "end": 1931.78, "text": "只有臂肉复生了,"}, {"start": 1935.25, "end": 1937.25, "text": "庸庸碌碌,"}, {"start": 1937.25, "end": 1939.25, "text": "日月蹉跎,"}, {"start": 1939.25, "end": 1941.25, "text": "老知将至,"}, {"start": 1943.25, "end": 1945.25, "text": "宣德,"}, {"start": 1945.25, "end": 1947.25, "text": "你还不满五十,"}, {"start": 1947.25, "end": 1949.25, "text": "就感叹,"}, {"start": 1949.25, "end": 1953.17, "text": "老知将至,"}, {"start": 1953.17, "end": 1955.17, "text": "我已经六世有四,"}, {"start": 1957.17, "end": 1959.17, "text": "又当如何呢?"}, {"start": 1959.17, "end": 1961.17, "text": "今日请你来,"}, {"start": 1961.17, "end": 1963.17, "text": "是有一世,"}, {"start": 1963.17, "end": 1965.17, "text": "隐忍多年,"}, {"start": 1965.17, "end": 1967.17, "text": "苦恼不可,"}, {"start": 1967.17, "end": 1970.9, "text": "想请你,"}, {"start": 1970.9, "end": 1972.9, "text": "为我一决,"}, {"start": 1972.9, "end": 1976.53, "text": "请明公吩咐,"}, {"start": 1976.53, "end": 1983.62, "text": "我有两个儿子,"}, {"start": 1983.62, "end": 1985.62, "text": "长子刘齐,"}, {"start": 1985.62, "end": 1987.62, "text": "是前妻所生,"}, {"start": 1989.62, "end": 1991.62, "text": "人虽然贤良,"}, {"start": 1991.62, "end": 1993.62, "text": "却性格柔弱,"}, {"start": 1993.62, "end": 1995.62, "text": "难以脱大业,"}, {"start": 1997.62, "end": 1999.62, "text": "四子刘从,"}, {"start": 1999.62, "end": 2001.62, "text": "是后妻蔡氏所生,"}, {"start": 2001.62, "end": 2005.25, "text": "聪明灵敏,"}, {"start": 2005.25, "end": 2007.25, "text": "迫让我喜安,"}, {"start": 2007.25, "end": 2009.25, "text": "蔡氏主打内部,"}, {"start": 2009.25, "end": 2011.25, "text": "提帝蔡茂,"}, {"start": 2011.25, "end": 2014.5, "text": "又是荆州的上将军,"}, {"start": 2014.5, "end": 2016.5, "text": "他二人,"}, {"start": 2016.5, "end": 2020.29, "text": "多次劝我,"}, {"start": 2020.29, "end": 2022.29, "text": "非常利用,"}, {"start": 2022.29, "end": 2024.29, "text": "让我好生为难,"}, {"start": 2028.24, "end": 2030.24, "text": "明公啊,"}, {"start": 2030.24, "end": 2032.24, "text": "你知道,"}, {"start": 2032.24, "end": 2034.24, "text": "袁绍为何败亡吗?"}, {"start": 2034.24, "end": 2036.24, "text": "近人皆知,"}, {"start": 2036.24, "end": 2038.24, "text": "袁绍,"}, {"start": 2038.24, "end": 2040.24, "text": "袁绍,"}, {"start": 2040.24, "end": 2042.24, "text": "是被曹操所败,"}, {"start": 2042.24, "end": 2045.65, "text": "除了曹操善用兵外,"}, {"start": 2045.65, "end": 2047.65, "text": "袁绍,"}, {"start": 2047.65, "end": 2049.65, "text": "另有内患,"}, {"start": 2049.65, "end": 2051.65, "text": "那就是,"}, {"start": 2051.65, "end": 2053.65, "text": "他的三位公子,"}, {"start": 2053.65, "end": 2055.65, "text": "为世子之位相争不下,"}, {"start": 2055.65, "end": 2057.65, "text": "临敌之际,"}, {"start": 2057.65, "end": 2059.65, "text": "甚至见死不救,"}, {"start": 2059.65, "end": 2061.65, "text": "这才使得他,"}, {"start": 2061.65, "end": 2063.65, "text": "大败于曹操,"}, {"start": 2063.65, "end": 2065.65, "text": "明公,"}, {"start": 2065.65, "end": 2067.65, "text": "恕在下直言,"}, {"start": 2067.65, "end": 2069.65, "text": "为掌利诱,"}, {"start": 2069.65, "end": 2071.65, "text": "自古便是曲乱之道,"}, {"start": 2071.65, "end": 2073.65, "text": "更何况,"}, {"start": 2073.65, "end": 2075.65, "text": "你已经说过,"}, {"start": 2075.65, "end": 2077.65, "text": "刘齐贤良啊,"}, {"start": 2077.65, "end": 2079.65, "text": "即使,"}, {"start": 2079.65, "end": 2081.65, "text": "我有立刘齐之意,"}, {"start": 2081.65, "end": 2083.65, "text": "但,"}, {"start": 2083.65, "end": 2085.65, "text": "蔡氏一门,"}, {"start": 2085.65, "end": 2087.65, "text": "荆州望族,"}, {"start": 2087.65, "end": 2089.65, "text": "士胜力强,"}, {"start": 2089.65, "end": 2091.65, "text": "他们要不愿意,"}, {"start": 2091.65, "end": 2093.65, "text": "我怕,"}, {"start": 2093.65, "end": 2095.65, "text": "激起内乱啊,"}, {"start": 2095.65, "end": 2105.94, "text": "明公,"}, {"start": 2105.94, "end": 2107.94, "text": "今日端午佳节,"}, {"start": 2107.94, "end": 2109.94, "text": "在下敬你一中,"}, {"start": 2109.94, "end": 2111.94, "text": "祝贵府佳人和睦,"}, {"start": 2111.94, "end": 2113.94, "text": "荆州太平昌盛,"}, {"start": 2113.94, "end": 2120.22, "text": "宣德,"}, {"start": 2120.22, "end": 2122.22, "text": "今晚,"}, {"start": 2122.22, "end": 2124.22, "text": "就不要回新野了,"}, {"start": 2124.22, "end": 2126.22, "text": "就在客馆住下,"}, {"start": 2126.22, "end": 2128.22, "text": "明日,"}, {"start": 2128.22, "end": 2130.22, "text": "咱接着喝酒,"}, {"start": 2130.22, "end": 2139.1, "text": "明公啊,"}, {"start": 2139.1, "end": 2145.9, "text": "刚才,"}, {"start": 2145.9, "end": 2147.9, "text": "在屋内,"}, {"start": 2147.9, "end": 2149.9, "text": "多言,"}, {"start": 2149.9, "end": 2151.9, "text": "现在,"}, {"start": 2151.9, "end": 2153.9, "text": "让我斗胆说一句话,"}, {"start": 2153.9, "end": 2155.9, "text": "立世子之事,"}, {"start": 2155.9, "end": 2157.9, "text": "性命攸关啊,"}, {"start": 2157.9, "end": 2159.9, "text": "只能明公,"}, {"start": 2159.9, "end": 2161.9, "text": "一人做主,"}, {"start": 2161.9, "end": 2163.9, "text": "任何人不能介入,"}, {"start": 2163.9, "end": 2165.9, "text": "如果明公,"}, {"start": 2165.9, "end": 2167.9, "text": "忧虑蔡氏一门权重,"}, {"start": 2167.9, "end": 2169.9, "text": "应该徐徒血治,"}, {"start": 2169.9, "end": 2171.9, "text": "否则,"}, {"start": 2171.9, "end": 2178.35, "text": "谁为荆州之主啊?"}, {"start": 2178.35, "end": 2180.35, "text": "多谢明公美酒,"}, {"start": 2180.35, "end": 2182.35, "text": "在下暂且告辞,"}, {"start": 2182.35, "end": 2205.47, "text": "明日相会。"}, {"start": 2205.47, "end": 2207.47, "text": "你这是怎么了?"}, {"start": 2207.47, "end": 2209.47, "text": "有何话,起来说。"}, {"start": 2209.47, "end": 2211.47, "text": "主公,"}, {"start": 2211.47, "end": 2213.47, "text": "平亲害怕。"}, {"start": 2213.47, "end": 2215.47, "text": "你怕什么?"}, {"start": 2215.47, "end": 2220.54, "text": "平亲害怕,"}, {"start": 2220.54, "end": 2222.54, "text": "刘备会夺了你的荆州,"}, {"start": 2222.54, "end": 2224.54, "text": "会灭了我们蔡氏满门。"}, {"start": 2224.54, "end": 2226.54, "text": "你怎么会有这个念头?"}, {"start": 2226.54, "end": 2230.3, "text": "刘备和刘齐,"}, {"start": 2230.3, "end": 2232.3, "text": "已经抱成团了。"}, {"start": 2232.3, "end": 2234.3, "text": "刘备此次来荆州,"}, {"start": 2234.3, "end": 2236.3, "text": "就是刘齐请来的。"}, {"start": 2236.3, "end": 2238.3, "text": "刘齐想利用刘备,"}, {"start": 2238.3, "end": 2240.3, "text": "帮他立为世子,"}, {"start": 2240.3, "end": 2242.3, "text": "而刘备则想利用刘齐,"}, {"start": 2242.3, "end": 2244.3, "text": "帮他谋取荆州。"}, {"start": 2244.3, "end": 2246.3, "text": "主公,"}, {"start": 2246.3, "end": 2248.3, "text": "如果不除掉刘备,"}, {"start": 2248.3, "end": 2250.3, "text": "恐怕,"}, {"start": 2250.3, "end": 2252.3, "text": "早晚会大祸临头啊。"}, {"start": 2252.3, "end": 2254.3, "text": "胡言乱语。"}, {"start": 2254.3, "end": 2256.3, "text": "主公,"}, {"start": 2256.3, "end": 2258.3, "text": "也许是贫妾多虑了。"}, {"start": 2258.3, "end": 2260.3, "text": "但是,"}, {"start": 2260.3, "end": 2262.3, "text": "请主公好声想想,"}, {"start": 2262.3, "end": 2264.3, "text": "难道贫妾所说的,"}, {"start": 2264.3, "end": 2266.3, "text": "就绝无可能吗?"}, {"start": 2266.3, "end": 2268.3, "text": "难道他们,"}, {"start": 2268.3, "end": 2270.3, "text": "就没有半点那样的念头吗?"}, {"start": 2270.3, "end": 2277.23, "text": "就算是贫妾胡言乱语,"}, {"start": 2277.23, "end": 2281.34, "text": "请主公多多少少,"}, {"start": 2281.34, "end": 2283.34, "text": "也提防着点。"}, {"start": 2283.34, "end": 2306.02, "text": "你找我。"}, {"start": 2306.02, "end": 2308.02, "text": "再不动手,恐怕就来不及了。"}, {"start": 2308.02, "end": 2310.02, "text": "出什么事了?"}, {"start": 2310.02, "end": 2312.02, "text": "主公今晚宴请刘备,"}, {"start": 2312.02, "end": 2314.02, "text": "只请了他一人。"}, {"start": 2314.02, "end": 2316.02, "text": "西间,"}, {"start": 2316.02, "end": 2318.02, "text": "主公秘密向刘备"}, {"start": 2318.02, "end": 2320.02, "text": "征询立楚的看法。"}, {"start": 2320.02, "end": 2323.3, "text": "刘备说,"}, {"start": 2323.3, "end": 2325.3, "text": "费掌利诱,"}, {"start": 2325.3, "end": 2327.3, "text": "自古便是取乱之道。"}, {"start": 2327.3, "end": 2329.3, "text": "这次好大胆,"}, {"start": 2329.3, "end": 2331.3, "text": "竟敢干涉我荆州正事。"}, {"start": 2331.3, "end": 2333.3, "text": "他还跟主公说,"}, {"start": 2333.3, "end": 2335.3, "text": "袁绍之所以兵败,"}, {"start": 2335.3, "end": 2337.3, "text": "就是因为诸子征大魏,"}, {"start": 2337.3, "end": 2339.3, "text": "彼此见死不救,"}, {"start": 2339.3, "end": 2341.3, "text": "由内乱导致败亡。"}, {"start": 2341.3, "end": 2346.02, "text": "你听听,"}, {"start": 2346.02, "end": 2348.02, "text": "他这不是想趁乱谋取荆州吗?"}, {"start": 2348.02, "end": 2350.02, "text": "此人要是不除,"}, {"start": 2350.02, "end": 2355.09, "text": "马上就要大祸临头。"}, {"start": 2355.09, "end": 2357.09, "text": "刘备现在何处?"}, {"start": 2357.09, "end": 2359.09, "text": "主公让他今晚别回新野,"}, {"start": 2359.09, "end": 2361.09, "text": "就住在客馆内。"}, {"start": 2361.09, "end": 2363.09, "text": "我立刻调集人马,"}, {"start": 2363.09, "end": 2365.09, "text": "趁夜杀之,"}, {"start": 2365.09, "end": 2367.09, "text": "绝出后患。"}, {"start": 2367.09, "end": 2369.09, "text": "然后,"}, {"start": 2369.09, "end": 2371.09, "text": "我自就向主公请罪。"}, {"start": 2371.09, "end": 2373.09, "text": "二弟只管放手去做。"}, {"start": 2373.09, "end": 2375.09, "text": "我料想,"}, {"start": 2375.09, "end": 2377.09, "text": "主公即便知道刘备被杀,"}, {"start": 2377.09, "end": 2379.09, "text": "虽然恼怒,"}, {"start": 2379.09, "end": 2381.09, "text": "却也不至于治你的罪。"}, {"start": 2381.09, "end": 2383.09, "text": "这是为何?"}, {"start": 2383.09, "end": 2389.34, "text": "你向主公请罪的时候,"}, {"start": 2389.34, "end": 2391.34, "text": "我和刘从,"}, {"start": 2391.34, "end": 2393.34, "text": "也会跪在你的身边,"}, {"start": 2393.34, "end": 2395.34, "text": "一起向他哭诉。"}, {"start": 2395.34, "end": 2397.34, "text": "而主公,"}, {"start": 2397.34, "end": 2399.34, "text": "他肯定心知肚明。"}, {"start": 2399.34, "end": 2401.34, "text": "他知道,"}, {"start": 2401.34, "end": 2403.34, "text": "荆州的军政大部落于蔡氏之手。"}, {"start": 2403.34, "end": 2405.34, "text": "他即便是想杀,"}, {"start": 2405.34, "end": 2407.34, "text": "他既杀不动你,"}, {"start": 2407.34, "end": 2409.34, "text": "也杀不动我。"}, {"start": 2409.34, "end": 2411.34, "text": "更舍不得,"}, {"start": 2411.34, "end": 2413.34, "text": "杀他的爱子刘从。"}, {"start": 2413.34, "end": 2415.34, "text": "更何况,"}, {"start": 2415.34, "end": 2417.34, "text": "他年事已高,"}, {"start": 2417.34, "end": 2419.34, "text": "别无所靠。"}, {"start": 2419.34, "end": 2421.34, "text": "他只能依靠你我,"}, {"start": 2421.34, "end": 2423.34, "text": "来帮他维持荆州大业。"}, {"start": 2423.34, "end": 2425.34, "text": "所以,"}, {"start": 2425.34, "end": 2427.34, "text": "他定会接受"}, {"start": 2427.34, "end": 2431.33, "text": "继承事实。"}, {"start": 2431.33, "end": 2433.33, "text": "原来,"}, {"start": 2433.33, "end": 2435.33, "text": "姐把一切都料理好了。"}, {"start": 2435.33, "end": 2437.33, "text": "我这就去办。"}, {"start": 2437.33, "end": 2439.33, "text": "有一件事你必须当心,"}, {"start": 2439.33, "end": 2441.33, "text": "就是刘备手下的那些汉将们。"}, {"start": 2441.33, "end": 2443.33, "text": "刘备被杀,"}, {"start": 2443.33, "end": 2445.33, "text": "那些人肯定是要为主子复仇的。"}, {"start": 2447.33, "end": 2449.33, "text": "关张罩虽然英勇,"}, {"start": 2449.33, "end": 2451.33, "text": "但我荆州将士也绝非庸俗啊。"}, {"start": 2451.33, "end": 2453.33, "text": "我们数十万人马,"}, {"start": 2453.33, "end": 2455.33, "text": "难道还灭不掉他两三千人啊?"}, {"start": 2455.33, "end": 2457.33, "text": "再说了,刘备已死,群龙无首,"}, {"start": 2457.33, "end": 2459.33, "text": "军心随之大乱,"}, {"start": 2459.33, "end": 2461.33, "text": "九杀他们易如反掌。"}, {"start": 2461.33, "end": 2463.33, "text": "说得好,"}, {"start": 2463.33, "end": 2465.33, "text": "快去办吧。"}, {"start": 2465.33, "end": 2467.33, "text": "遵命。"}]